 "strings": {
  "I can't get enough.": "",
  "Urgh... I can't get enough!": "",
  "I can't hold myself back!": "",
  "I just love teats!": "",
  "If I only had some money.": "",
  "Just gotta keep workin' hard.": "",
  "Work! Focus on work!": "",
  "Whatcha lookin' at?": "",
  "Eh? Oh...": "",
  "You... Just keep yer eyes on me.": "",
  "Thanks fer comin' back ta see me.": "",
  "Won't be away fer long, will ya?": "",
  "Heehee! I'm happy!": "",
  "Been waitin' fer ya!": "",
  "Man, that guy before was damn strong.": "",
  "Somethin' happen?": "",
  "Buddy, it was a sight to see.": "",
  "That izakaya's okami is okay, right?": "",
  "Heard there was a big showdown nearby.": "",
  "Damn drunks sure are trouble.": "",
  "Ya hear Izo's been caught?": "",
  "Yeah. Butcher finally got what was comin' to him. Shinsengumi did somethin' right fer once.": "",
  "Hm? Whaddya mean?": "",
  "I thought the magistrate captured him.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah, that's the official story.": "",
  "But truth is, someone else took Izo down before the doshin ever showed.": "",
  "Shinsengumi.": "",
  "Wha? Seriously?": "",
  "Yeah. All those guys in blue rushed the gamblin' den.": "",
  "Heard it straight from the guy what runs the place.": "",
  "This Ikedaya thing's crazy, huh?": "",
  "The Shinsengumi raid, ya mean?": "",
  "Yeah. Apparently the Shinsengumi found out the people there were plannin' to start a fire in the city.": "",
  "Damn! That's wild shit! What's goin' on with people these days?": "",
  "Ha. Leave it to the goddamn Choshuans to come up with somethin' like that.": "",
  "Guess so. But if their plan worked, we'd all be screwed.": "",
  "Glad the Wolves got their heads outta their asses.": "",
  "Maybe they're not jus' a buncha useless killers.": "",
  "Yeah, well, fer all we know, the Shinsengumi made up the whole story anyway.": "",
  "Who'd benefit from settin' fire ta the palace? It makes no damn sense.": "",
  "You gotta point. Heh, they almost had me fooled.": "",
  "Yeah. The Mibu Wolves never helped no one but themselves.": "",
  "Heard they fished a body outta there. That true?": "",
  "Yeah. Not jus' that, the body was a Shinsengumi member.": "",
  "Had one of them pale blue coats on.": "",
  "Eh? No shit?": "",
  "Damn, but... I guess it makes sense.": "",
  "Those Wolves... They've earned themselves plenty of grudges.": "",
  "True enough. Just desserts, I guess.": "",
  "Well, whoever's behind it, better we don't get involved.": "",
  "Knowin' 'em, the Mibu Wolves're about to go on a rampage to find the culprit.": "",
  "Right. Gotta keep our heads down.": "",
  "Yeah. I'll let the kids know to stay inside for a while.": "",
  "'Ey, you hear?": "",
  "Yeah, the Shinsengumi body?": "",
  "Ah. Heard somethin' new. Apparently the dead bastard was a captain.": "",
  "Seriously? Well, now it makes sense.": "",
  "They been lookin' around with a fury since then.": "",
  "Hafta catch a captain-killer, fer sure.": "",
  "Yeah. So it'd seem.": "",
  "Ain't the captains supposed to be crazy strong, though?": "",
  "Who can say? Their captains run the gamut, I hear.": "",
  "An' that one was on the old side, s'pposedly.": "",
  "Didn't know that.": "",
  "Even the Shinsengumi can't beat back time, I guess.": "",
  "You said it.": "",
  "Damn. Hope they catch whoever did it soon.": "",
  "Things get real scary 'round here when the Wolves go wild.": "",
  "Ikedaya first and now Teradaya?": "",
  "Shinsengumi raids?": "",
  "It's terrifyin'.": "",
  "Sure is.": "",
  "Hey, you don't sound too scared, actually.": "",
  "Hm. Know somethin'?": "",
  "Them Shinsengumi, they got some okay folk in there.": "",
  "Other day, friend a mine got saved by one.": "",
  "Is that true?": "",
  "Hard ta believe, from what I seen.": "",
  "Oh well. If only they were all goodies. Not jus' a few.": "",
  "Hey there, what's the gossip today?": "",
  "Talkin' 'bout the Teradaya. Know anythin'?": "",
  "Ah. Heard the Shinsengumi were after some ronin. Wonder who it was, specifically.": "",
  "Heard they got away, though.": "",
  "All this shit's so confusin'.": "",
  "Shinsengumi captain just got done in, right?": "",
  "Stands ta reason... The ronin was the one what killed him, yeah?": "",
  "That'd make sense.": "",
  "But then he gets away somehow?": "",
  "Either the Shinsengumi's gettin' slow or this guy's a real fox.": "",
  "Yeah. Guess so.": "",
  "Ya know, the Mimawarigumi showed up 'n' pushed 'em back.": "",
  "Whoa, is that true?": "",
  "Yeah. I jus' happened to be nearby an' overheard it.": "",
  "Lotta raised voices. Shinsengumi and Mimawarigumi both.": "",
  "Shit, and they really backed down? Mibu Wolves ain't shit after all.": "",
  "Shinsengumi are probably no match for the Mimawarigumi, end a the day.": "",
  "Makes sense, since the Mimawarigumi are Bakufu vassals.": "",
  "Teradaya was harborin' that ronin...": "",
  "Oh yeah. The Satsuma and Chosu alliance-maker, ya mean?": "",
  "Whoa, really?": "",
  "In that case, the Shinsengumi probably wanted him dead.": "",
  "I've heard all kindsa rumors 'bout him too.": "",
  "Wonder what kinda guy he is.": "",
  "Why'd the Shinsengumi start that damn fire?": "",
  "They musta all gone nuts. All of 'em.": "",
  "Seems so.": "",
  "Hm? Wait, wasn't there some other story 'bout tryin' to burn Kyo down?": "",
  "Right? Back at Ikedaya...": "",
  "Oh, that thing.": "",
  "They were gonna light up the palace.": "",
  "Ain't that strange?": "",
  "The Shinsengumi raided 'em to stop 'em doin' that.": "",
  "Why would the Wolves go an' set their own fire now?": "",
  "Huh. Think there's anythin' to that?": "",
  "Has ta be.": "",
  "Shinsengumi's done fer.": "",
  "Yeah. Heard about those defections.": "",
  "I'm confused. I thought they silence anybody who leaves 'em?": "",
  "What makes this time any different?": "",
  "This shit ain't like the other defections.": "",
  "Shinsengumi lost the majority a their men.": "",
  "Wha? Can hardly believe that.": "",
  "Yeah. That's why I say it's the end fer 'em.": "",
  "Damn, yer really in the know.": "",
  "Y'all hear? That goddamn fire was the Shinsengumi after all.": "",
  "Yeah, that's what everybody's sayin'.": "",
  "I don't get it. The Shinsengumi stopped a fire before, didn't they?": "",
  "Ah. Yeah, they stopped them folks who wanted to burn up the palace.": "",
  "The ones at Ikedaya.": "",
  "So, what, did they just wanna do it themselves?": "",
  "Well, shit, they're the Mibu Wolves. They're all crazy.": "",
  "Damn straight. I hope they're all gone from Kyo before long.": "",
  "What're they called? Them Shinsengumi defectors?": "",
  "The Goryo Eji?": "",
  "Oh. Yeah, them.": "",
  "Apparently, two a their officers are already dead.": "",
  "Well. It is what it is.": "",
  "You know anythin'?": "",
  "Nah. I got nothin'.": "",
  "But ya know the Shinsengumi still got some able swords, right?": "",
  "So, maybe if the other guys've got the numbers, they're still bein' silenced all the same?": "",
  "Yeah. Maybe that's so.": "",
  "Reputation an' shit, huh?": "",
  "Wait, hold on.": "",
  "If that's so, ain't this gonna carry on till one side's jus' annihilated?": "",
  "Yeah, maybe.": "",
  "Geez, we restore imperial rule, and Kyo's just as lawless as ever.": "",
  "What happened over at Omiya?": "",
  "Oh. That stuff?": "",
  "Hell if I know who did it.": "",
  "But... the Mimawarigumi surrounded the place, right?": "",
  "If that's so, were they behind it all?": "",
  "But they say the guy who formed the Satcho Alliance died in there.": "",
  "Yeah. I heard that too.": "",
  "And the Shinsengumi were there too, right?": "",
  "No way the Mimawarigumi and Shinsengumi worked together. Never.": "",
  "Yer right. What's happenin' these days?": "",
  "Hun... gry...": "",
